   "name": "Master Apothecary Faranell",
   "npc": "2055",
   "questID": 513,
   "race": "Tauren",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Can you not see I am busy, $c?  The Dark Lady insists on a new plague before the Scourge advance from Northrend overwhelms us.  And with the human threat pressing from the south, time becomes my most precious commodity.  This better be important!",
   "time": 1791578369,
