   "event": "accept",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1417,
   "name": "Zaruk",
   "npc": "2787",
   "questID": 95663,
   "race": "Tauren",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "The Dragonmaw are a formidable clan.\r\n\r\nThey're known for binding magic strong enough to make dragons serve, and rumor claims they're preparing some display of it in the Wetlands. Whether truth or bluster, the Deathstalkers can't act on half-formed whispers. Broken symbols carried only that much to me.\r\n\r\nA deathstalker agent needs a hand in the hills above the Dragonmaw encampment. Meet her there. She'll reveal the next steps.",
   "time": 1791578026,
   "title": "Dragonmaw Rumors",
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Arathi Highlands"
  },
